      <lg><l>   de ltar rgyas 'bring bsdus pa mdo'i don ||</l> <l>bden gnyis nyi zla'i 'od kyis gsal ba'i gzhung ||</l> <l>chan tig ngag don gsum tshan re re dang ||</l> <l>don bzhin ston pa mdo'i lung dang sbyar ||</l> <l><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3720">dpal ldan klu sgrub</rs> grags pa'i gzhung lugs la ||</l> <l>rab sbyangs
      <pb n="57b"/><lb n="57b1"/> blo mig ldan pa mang mod kyang ||</l> <l>sbyangs pa'i stobs kyis gzung don nges gyur pa ||</l> <l><rs type="place" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="place:5559">gangs can</rs> 'di na ston pa <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:3931">kho bo</rs> tsam ||</l> <l>gzhung 'di brjod tshogs snying por ma byas shing ||</l> <l>de dag tshig gsal gzhung don rab gsal ba'i ||</l> <l>rnam dpyad snying po blo'i nor ldan pa ||</l> <l><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3931">shag kya'i dog blo khag rings ston pa</rs>s sbyar ||</l> <l>'di sbyar sbyor ba bsam pa sngon btang dang ||</l> <l>dngos gzhi dge ba <lb n="57b2"/> rang bzhin med dge dang ||</l> <l>de rjes dga' ba'i bsod nams mthu yis kyang ||</l> <l>'gro rnams kun mkhyen go 'phang thob par shog ||</l></lg> || </seg>
